    {"drillName": "Pistol Qual Stage 1", "builtIn": true,
      "description": "Distance: 3-yard line (grassy area between the timber beams and the concrete)\nRounds/Time: 3 rounds in 4 seconds / SWAP TO SUPPORT HAND / 3 rounds in 4 seconds\nPart 1 (4 s): On command, the shooter draws and fires 3 rounds in the high thoracic cavity STRONG HAND ONLY. The shooter then slowly swaps the handgun to the support hand and stays in the low ready position.\nPart 2 (4 s): On command, the shooter fires 3 rounds in the high thoracic cavity from low ready SUPPORT HAND ONLY.\nUpon completing Stage 1, the shooter holsters.",
